>​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是自己所得，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0037em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 衡量对劣势不平等的厌恶（通常 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>≥</mo><msub><mi>β</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha_i \\geq \\beta_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.786em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0037em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0528em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>β</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0528em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 衡量对优势不平等的厌恶（且 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>β</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0 \\leq \\beta_i &lt; 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7804em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0528em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>）。这个简洁的函数一举解释了多个现象：最后通牒里 B 拒绝低 offer，是因为接受会带来巨大的劣势不平等惩罚项，宁可两清；A 给出近半，则是为了规避自己的优势不平等愧疚与被拒风险。这里的「不喜欢比别人少」与损失厌恶有共鸣，参照点机制见<a href=\"risk-uncertainty-decisions\">风险与不确定性下的决策</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"互惠模型-意图比结果更重要\">互惠模型：意图比结果更重要</h2><p>不平等厌恶只看最终分配，但有一类现象它解释不了：同样一个低 offer，若是对方故意给的，人会愤怒拒绝；若是电脑随机生成的，人却往往接受。差别在于「意图」。互惠模型（拉宾 1993，及后续的序贯互惠模型）认为，人会以善意回报善意、以恶意回报恶意，关键变量是对方行为背后的意图是否友善。</p>\n<p>这解释了信任博弈里 B 的回报：B 之所以回报，不仅因为不平等厌恶，更因为 A 的投资本身是一种善意的示信，触发了 B 的正向互惠。负向互惠则解释了惩罚——人愿自掏腰包惩罚那些意图不良者，这种「利他性惩罚」在群体合作的维系中扮演关键角色，详见<a href=\"public-goods-cooperation\">公共品与合作</a>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[对方做出某行为] --&gt; B{我如何评价其意图?}&#10;    B --&gt;|友善| C[正向互惠&lt;br/&gt;回报善意]&#10;    B --&gt;|恶意| D[负向互惠&lt;br/&gt;惩罚恶意]&#10;    C --&gt; E[信任博弈中 B 回报投资]&#10;    D --&gt; F[最后通牒中拒绝故意低offer]&#10;    F --&gt; G[对比: 电脑随机低offer&lt;br/&gt;常被接受]&#10;    G --&gt; H[证据: 意图而非仅结果&lt;br/&gt;驱动选择]\">graph TD\n    A[对方做出某行为] --&gt; B{我如何评价其意图?}\n    B --&gt;|友善| C[正向互惠&lt;br/&gt;回报善意]\n    B --&gt;|恶意| D[负向互惠&lt;br/&gt;惩罚恶意]\n    C --&gt; E[信任博弈中 B 回报投资]\n    D --&gt; F[最后通牒中拒绝故意低offer]\n    F --&gt; G[对比: 电脑随机低offer&lt;br/&gt;常被接受]\n    G --&gt; H[证据: 意图而非仅结果&lt;br/&gt;驱动选择]</pre><h2 id=\"跨文化与稳健性\">跨文化与稳健性</h2><p>社会偏好不是西方实验室的特产。亨里希等人主导的跨 15 个小规模社会的大型研究发现，最后通牒博弈的提议与拒绝模式在不同文化间差异显著，且与该社会的市场整合度、合作生产程度相关——市场越发达、越依赖与陌生人合作的社会，人们越倾向公平分配。这一发现既支持社会偏好的普遍存在，又提醒其具体强度受文化与制度塑造，呼应了<a href=\"../methodology/lab-field-natural-experiments\">实验室、田野与自然实验</a>对外部效度的关切。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>社会偏好指效用还取决于他人所得与公平，最后通牒博弈最早证伪了纯自利的经济人假设。</li>\n<li>三个博弈分离动机：最后通牒测公平+惩罚，独裁者测纯利他，信任博弈测信任+互惠。</li>\n<li>不平等厌恶模型（费尔-施密特）把对劣势与优势不平等的厌恶写进效用，解释拒绝与慷慨。</li>\n<li>互惠模型强调意图：人以善报善、以恶报恶，解释了电脑 offer 与人 offer 的差别反应。</li>\n<li>跨文化研究显示社会偏好普遍存在但强度受市场整合度塑造；利他性惩罚通向<a href=\"public-goods-cooperation\">公共品与合作</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"社会偏好（最后通牒·独裁者·信任博弈）","id":"社会偏好-最后通牒-独裁者-信任博弈"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"三个博弈如何分离动机","id":"三个博弈如何分离动机"},{"level":2,"text":"不平等厌恶模型：把公平写进效用","id":"不平等厌恶模型-把公平写进效用"},{"level":2,"text":"互惠模型：意图比结果更重要","id":"互惠模型-意图比结果更重要"},{"level":2,"text":"跨文化与稳健性","id":"跨文化与稳健性"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"偏好引出与决策异象","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/experimental-economics/individual-decision/preference-elicitation-anomalies"},"next":{"title":"公共品与合作","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/experimental-economics/games-markets/public-goods-cooperation"}}